#### Phase 5: Create Unified Dashboards

1. **Import Grafana dashboards** for Kubernetes monitoring:
   - Cluster Overview: Node CPU/memory, pod count, namespace resources
   - Application Performance: Request rate, latency percentiles (p50/p95/p99), error rate
   - Cost Monitoring: Resource utilization, idle resources

2. **Create custom dashboard** for business metrics:
```json
{
  "dashboard": {
    "title": "Healthcare Application Metrics",
    "panels": [
      {
        "title": "Claims Processed per Hour",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "rate(claims_processed_total[1h])"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Member Eligibility Lookups",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "rate(eligibility_lookups_total[5m])"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "API Latency (p95)",
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m]))"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
